										<div class="text-[13px] font-semibold">Vesk Source - .vsk, TypeScript, Tailwind, Motion</div>
										<div class="text-[12.5px] leading-5 text-zinc-400 mt-1">You write familiar components. Every TypeScript construct survives codegen and passes through vskToTsx for tsc.</div>
